mutation lose the persistent trip on a second refresh before any data returns
detects ChoicePreserved
-            /\ key' = key /\ wanted' = wanted
+            /\ key' = (IF phase = "waiting" THEN Unset ELSE key) /\ wanted' = wanted

mutation silently switch to the first trip when the selected one disappears
detects SelectionCorrect
-          IN IF matches = {} THEN 0
+          IN IF matches = {} THEN IF Len(b)>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0

mutation keep the old vehicle after selecting another station
detects ChoicePreserved
-          /\ key' = Unset /\ wanted' = Unset /\ hit' = "fresh"
+          /\ key' = key /\ wanted' = Unset /\ hit' = "fresh"

mutation select the first trip when the previous vehicle has no stable ID
detects SelectionCorrect
-     ELSE IF k = Anonymous THEN 0
+     ELSE IF k = Anonymous THEN IF Len(b)>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0

mutation keep showing the previous timetable while fetching new arrivals
detects HiddenWhileWaiting
- Refresh == /\ phase' = "waiting" /\ rows' = <<>> /\ index' = 0 /\ expected' = 0
+ Refresh == /\ phase' = "waiting" /\ rows' = rows /\ index' = 0 /\ expected' = 0
